<title>USA: Rockwell Chairman Don Beall to retire.</title>
<headline>Rockwell Chairman Don Beall to retire.</headline>
<dateline>SEAL BEACH, Calif. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rockwell International Corp. Chairman and Chief Executive Don Beall announced his retirement on Wednesday after leading the company through a decade of transformation.</p>
<p>Beall, 58, said in a statement that he plans to step down as chief executive on Sept. 30, at the end of the company's current fiscal year, and as chairman in February, after Rockwell's annual shareholder meeting.</p>
